WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 13=

01:42.580 --> 01:44.860
It's my first time
dressing this formally.

01:45.220 --> 01:46.180
Feels a bit unusual.

01:46.666 --> 01:48.622
You'll get used to it after a few times.

01:49.340 --> 01:50.500
Will you come with me?

01:51.500 --> 01:52.300
I won't.

01:52.940 --> 01:54.780
It's Author Night, not Editor Night.

01:57.060 --> 01:58.860
You used to go before.

01:59.260 --> 02:00.340
You went with He Han.

02:06.460 --> 02:06.820
Hello.

02:07.300 --> 02:09.220
Do you have any bow ties I can try?

02:09.620 --> 02:11.500
This tie feels a bit off.

02:16.420 --> 02:17.600
Do you have other colors?

02:20.940 --> 02:21.740
Do you think

02:22.540 --> 02:23.500
standing next to me

02:23.500 --> 02:24.900
isn't as impressive

02:25.220 --> 02:26.300
as standing next to He Han?

02:26.980 --> 02:27.820
Of course not.

02:28.580 --> 02:29.460
Someone sloppy,

02:30.066 --> 02:31.288
always late or leaving early,

02:31.740 --> 02:32.300
face-blind,

02:32.977 --> 02:35.066
unwilling to handle
basic social interactions,

02:35.977 --> 02:37.460
and a walking bundle of trouble

02:37.580 --> 02:39.740
needs a person by his side
to smooth things over.

02:44.540 --> 02:45.980
So if I were like He Han,

02:46.580 --> 02:47.540
full of flaws,

02:47.780 --> 02:48.780
you'd go with me?

02:50.140 --> 02:51.300
You can't put it that way.

02:54.060 --> 02:54.780
Please come.

02:55.820 --> 02:57.860
For the sake of me
always submitting on time

02:58.340 --> 02:59.940
and not causing trouble,

03:00.460 --> 03:02.244
you wouldn't want
me to turn into He Han,

03:02.488 --> 03:03.620
a mess of issues, right?

03:06.820 --> 03:07.620
This looks good.

03:10.980 --> 03:11.340
Sir.

03:11.620 --> 03:11.980
Hey.

03:12.580 --> 03:13.260
Remember to pay.

03:18.500 --> 03:19.620
Boss, four buns.

03:19.620 --> 03:20.220
(Mengtong Internet Cafe)

03:20.220 --> 03:21.140
- I'm back.
- Alright.

03:21.260 --> 03:21.780
You're back.

03:22.860 --> 03:24.133
What's with all those bags?

03:24.155 --> 03:25.010
Bought these for me?

03:25.010 --> 03:26.860
Don't I need formal wear
for Author Night?

03:27.260 --> 03:27.900
Let me see.

03:29.900 --> 03:30.740
This looks high-end.

03:31.222 --> 03:32.533
Must've cost quite a bit.

03:32.740 --> 03:34.420
I don't know.
Ms. Lin bought them for me.

03:34.580 --> 03:36.066
By the way, this year at Author Night,

03:36.070 --> 03:37.710
I should be
the New Rising Author of the Year.

03:37.740 --> 03:39.180
Make sure you watch the livestream.

03:39.300 --> 03:40.820
Of course, we'll watch.

03:41.020 --> 03:42.780
And this, I brought it
specially for you guys.

03:42.860 --> 03:44.666
Remember to eat it tonight.
I'm heading back.

03:45.180 --> 03:46.180
You're not eating?

03:46.180 --> 03:46.900
Not joining us?

03:47.180 --> 03:48.460
I already ate.

03:48.511 --> 03:49.955
I still need to work on my manuscript.

03:50.860 --> 03:51.540
Just leave him.

03:51.660 --> 03:52.500
Can't you tell?

03:52.711 --> 03:54.511
He brought it just to show off to us.

03:54.820 --> 03:55.380
Let's eat.

03:56.220 --> 03:56.900
I'm not eating.

03:59.533 --> 04:00.780
Why aren't you eating either?

04:04.100 --> 04:04.540
I'll eat.

04:17.460 --> 04:19.060
Why are you dressed so formally today?

04:20.420 --> 04:21.740
Author Night is coming up.

04:21.980 --> 04:23.380
I agreed to go with Gu Yan.

04:24.088 --> 04:26.555
It's been a while since I
attended something like this.

04:27.140 --> 04:29.220
I wanted to try on
outfits and see what works.

04:30.700 --> 04:31.460
What is he wearing?

04:32.420 --> 04:33.500
I had a suit made for him.

04:35.500 --> 04:37.100
Finally, someone presentable.

04:37.711 --> 04:39.088
What do you think of this one?

04:41.220 --> 04:42.100
It looks nice.

04:44.220 --> 04:45.940
But I think your white one looks better.

04:47.500 --> 04:47.940
That one.

04:52.540 --> 04:53.300
Wait.

04:55.820 --> 04:56.420
Are you okay?

05:11.377 --> 05:12.100
No, that won't work.

05:12.100 --> 05:12.780
Why not?

05:16.820 --> 05:17.622
I've worn it before.

05:17.740 --> 05:18.740
So what?

05:19.260 --> 05:20.340
Celebrities nowadays

05:20.340 --> 05:21.940
even rewear clothes from ten years ago.

05:23.300 --> 05:23.820
Forget it.

05:24.380 --> 05:25.380
He Han gave me that one.

05:26.980 --> 05:27.733
Is he going, too?

05:28.820 --> 05:29.300
Not sure.

05:38.140 --> 05:39.100
What time is it?

05:40.000 --> 05:41.244
Why aren't you leaving yet?

05:42.620 --> 05:43.820
You've waited so long

05:44.100 --> 05:46.500
for this dinner,
and now that it's finally here,

05:46.500 --> 05:47.777
you're not in a hurry anymore?

05:47.820 --> 05:49.180
He said he'd be half an hour late.

05:49.500 --> 05:51.644
He's taking his wife back
to her parents' place first.

05:51.666 --> 05:52.866
You're not upset?

05:55.620 --> 05:56.820
What would being upset change?

05:57.220 --> 05:58.180
When I met him,

05:58.180 --> 05:59.180
he was already married.

05:59.420 --> 06:00.180
He never hid it.

06:00.555 --> 06:01.820
I can't stop him from dealing with

06:01.820 --> 06:02.660
his family matters.

06:03.500 --> 06:05.060
So you still hope

06:05.220 --> 06:06.460
he has a happy family

06:06.580 --> 06:07.700
and a complete life?

06:10.420 --> 06:11.660
In a way, yes.

06:13.100 --> 06:14.340
I really can't understand

06:15.177 --> 06:16.488
this situation between you two.

06:26.660 --> 06:27.460
I like him,

06:29.711 --> 06:32.022
but I've said I don't want
to ruin his family.

06:33.700 --> 06:35.100
I don't want to become Mrs. Bei.

06:46.380 --> 06:46.955
See you.

06:51.200 --> 06:52.644
Will Lawyer Bei be picking you up?

06:54.260 --> 06:54.820
Who else?

07:05.820 --> 07:06.820
May I ask who you are?

07:10.940 --> 07:11.860
You're Lin Zhanqiao?

07:13.620 --> 07:14.380
What do you want?

07:14.822 --> 07:15.940
Zhangzhu is your assistant?

07:16.180 --> 07:17.180
Answer my question first.

07:17.180 --> 07:18.100
What do you want?

07:18.180 --> 07:19.020
Where's Zhangzhu?

07:19.020 --> 07:19.940
She's not here.

07:22.540 --> 07:22.940
Fine.

07:23.660 --> 07:24.911
Then, I'll tell you directly.

07:25.420 --> 07:27.580
Have you been watching
too many short videos

07:27.580 --> 07:30.260
about those tricks
of handling divorced men?

07:30.377 --> 07:32.100
You think you've got
Zhangzhu under control,

07:32.100 --> 07:33.911
and then you can drive
a wedge between Cai and me?

07:33.940 --> 07:36.020
He may be muddled, but I'm not.

07:36.700 --> 07:37.260
Go ahead.

07:37.420 --> 07:38.620
Tell me what you want.

07:38.755 --> 07:39.733
You won't get the person.

07:39.820 --> 07:40.340
As for money,

07:41.177 --> 07:42.177
name your price.

07:43.140 --> 07:43.620
Go on.

07:45.060 --> 07:46.400
I don't know when

07:46.466 --> 07:47.660
or under what circumstances

07:47.660 --> 07:49.100
you met Cai and Zhangzhu,

07:49.300 --> 07:50.900
but I'm telling you, this is childish.

07:51.380 --> 07:52.220
Look at this.

07:52.500 --> 07:54.340
Cai and I are
getting married in a few days.

07:54.860 --> 07:56.930
Why are you stopping
Zhangzhu from coming?

07:56.930 --> 07:57.980
That's enough. Stop talking.

07:57.980 --> 07:58.660
I understand now.

07:59.177 --> 07:59.940
You should be glad

07:59.940 --> 08:01.530
I have no interest in
either Cai or his daughter.

08:01.540 --> 08:03.400
I'm going on a date with my boyfriend.

08:04.066 --> 08:05.400
You said it yourself just now.

08:05.444 --> 08:07.460
You have another boyfriend.
I'm going to tell Cai.

08:07.660 --> 08:09.300
Don't pull me. My clothes are expensive.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.755
If you tear them, Cai will pay.

08:13.288 --> 08:14.850
Don't touch me with your silicone pads.

08:14.888 --> 08:16.311
These are real. You're insulting me.

08:16.940 --> 08:17.860
Cai, listen,

08:18.100 --> 08:19.860
Lin Zhanqiao just said
she has a boyfriend.

08:19.860 --> 08:21.140
You've both been fooled.

08:21.666 --> 08:23.088
Can you stop making a scene?

08:24.020 --> 08:25.820
She's not my girlfriend at all.

08:26.700 --> 08:28.500
I've barely even spoken to her.

08:28.620 --> 08:29.180
I don't care.

08:32.740 --> 08:33.420
Where are you?

08:33.660 --> 08:34.666
Downstairs at her place.

08:35.740 --> 08:36.740
Fine, wait there.

08:41.180 --> 08:41.660
Doctor,

08:42.620 --> 08:43.140
well...

08:43.955 --> 08:45.311
I have something urgent.

08:45.420 --> 08:46.533
I need to leave first.

08:46.660 --> 08:48.022
How much longer will this take?

08:48.110 --> 08:50.977
We haven't done the left side yet.
There are a few more shots on the right.

08:51.900 --> 08:54.140
Then finish the right side.

08:54.700 --> 08:55.380
As for the left,

08:55.577 --> 08:56.888
I'll do it another day.

08:56.977 --> 08:59.177
Then let's schedule
another appointment tomorrow.

08:59.500 --> 08:59.900
Okay.

09:02.466 --> 09:03.933
If it weren't for the wedding,

09:04.540 --> 09:05.660
I wouldn't go through this.

09:07.755 --> 09:09.822
Doctor, didn't you say it wouldn't hurt?

09:17.377 --> 09:19.155
I've never seen
a woman as shameless as you.

09:19.177 --> 09:20.970
And I've never seen a woman
as foolish as you.

09:20.980 --> 09:21.380
Move.

09:22.500 --> 09:22.900
Zhou Mei.

09:25.700 --> 09:27.020
What did you just call her?

09:29.140 --> 09:30.420
Do you need any help?

09:31.500 --> 09:31.900
It's fine.

09:32.580 --> 09:33.540
Just pre-wedding nerves.

09:34.340 --> 09:35.340
You're not Lin Zhanqiao?

09:35.580 --> 09:36.700
I never said I was.

09:37.140 --> 09:38.660
You're the one who insisted I was.

09:38.820 --> 09:39.140
Well...

09:39.533 --> 09:40.822
If you're not Lin Zhanqiao,

09:40.866 --> 09:42.610
the one next to you in the photo
must be her.

09:42.620 --> 09:43.688
So where is Lin Zhanqiao?

09:43.700 --> 09:44.740
I need to find her.

09:45.100 --> 09:46.340
Are you obsessed?

09:46.340 --> 09:47.300
She's not home.

09:48.460 --> 09:49.355
What do you want?

09:50.660 --> 09:52.540
Call Cai Dezhang
and have him come pick you up.

09:52.820 --> 09:53.860
You're not Lin Zhanqiao.

09:53.860 --> 09:55.140
How do you know Cai Dezhang?

09:55.460 --> 09:56.700
Who says only Lin Zhanqiao

09:56.700 --> 09:57.740
can know Cai Dezhang?

09:58.088 --> 09:59.420
Please don't come any closer.

09:59.540 --> 10:00.660
You might get hit by a car.

10:02.900 --> 10:03.980
Hello, Mr. Cai?

10:05.900 --> 10:07.260
Could you come over for a moment?

10:07.860 --> 10:08.340
Thank you.

10:11.540 --> 10:11.900
Let's go.

10:12.740 --> 10:13.380
Wait a bit.

10:13.644 --> 10:14.822
Let's wait for him to arrive.

10:17.100 --> 10:17.900
I won't let her off.

10:17.900 --> 10:18.700
I will find her.

10:21.222 --> 10:23.266
You're worried
she'll go after Lin Zhanqiao?

10:26.460 --> 10:28.580
Looks like our dinner
will be delayed again.

10:29.977 --> 10:32.288
Spending another half hour
with you isn't so bad.

10:33.888 --> 10:35.955
What time will you
pick your wife up tonight?

10:37.180 --> 10:37.700
10 PM.

10:38.088 --> 10:39.260
I'll let you go on time.

10:48.666 --> 10:51.422
(The Road of Investment Banking)
(It was a rectangular office table,)

10:51.620 --> 10:53.060
(seating about ten people.)

10:53.700 --> 10:54.700
(On it were piled)

10:54.700 --> 10:56.780
(large black A4 folders,)

10:57.220 --> 10:58.580
(stack after stack,)

10:58.580 --> 10:59.820
(materials from the Fa Group,)

11:00.100 --> 11:02.380
(along with countless
scattered paper clips.)

11:03.580 --> 11:05.100
(Chai Hu's unusual behavior)

11:05.500 --> 11:07.820
(made Wang Muxue
pause what she was doing.)

11:09.980 --> 11:10.740
Hello, Zhangzhu.

11:11.140 --> 11:11.540
Ms. Lin,

11:12.300 --> 11:14.020
Dingqi Platform just sent

11:14.020 --> 11:15.460
fifty promising new authors

11:15.460 --> 11:17.220
based on their big data analysis.

11:17.860 --> 11:18.700
On my end,

11:18.980 --> 11:20.740
I quickly reviewed their genres,

11:20.860 --> 11:22.980
reader feedback, and writing style,

11:23.300 --> 11:24.780
and I've shortlisted twenty.

11:24.844 --> 11:26.180
I've already synced it to you.

11:26.977 --> 11:28.866
You're still at the office working late?

11:35.140 --> 11:36.620
Yes, I plan to go through

11:36.620 --> 11:38.500
more of their other works,

11:38.580 --> 11:40.820
then I'll head back.

11:42.980 --> 11:43.660
Have you eaten?

11:43.660 --> 11:44.620
Want me to save you some?

11:44.620 --> 11:45.700
No, I've eaten.

11:46.740 --> 11:49.540
I just ordered
some takeout at the office.

11:49.900 --> 11:51.060
Alright then, bye.

11:56.460 --> 11:57.355
(Generally speaking...)

11:58.780 --> 11:59.500
Mr. He Han,

12:01.660 --> 12:02.060
you see,

12:02.620 --> 12:04.266
if Ms. Lin knew I was here eating

12:04.288 --> 12:06.500
while you're helping me review novels,

12:06.844 --> 12:07.955
would she be upset?

12:10.540 --> 12:12.380
She'd pretend to be upset,

12:12.711 --> 12:14.400
but she'd actually be quite pleased.

12:19.900 --> 12:20.580
Mr. He Han, I...

12:20.711 --> 12:22.140
I'm done eating, so I'll leave first.

12:22.260 --> 12:23.020
Okay.

12:23.580 --> 12:24.780
Be careful on your way.

12:24.844 --> 12:25.822
We'll continue tomorrow.

12:25.900 --> 12:26.260
Alright.

12:45.940 --> 12:46.420
Hello,

12:46.844 --> 12:48.060
Guiyuan Fields Nursing Home.

12:49.140 --> 12:49.460
Yes.

12:50.180 --> 12:51.180
I'd like to ask,

12:51.940 --> 12:53.740
is there an elderly man named He Wei

12:53.740 --> 12:54.860
who checked in there?

12:56.380 --> 12:57.020
He Wei?

12:57.300 --> 12:58.860
Yes, Wei as in doing as one pleases.

12:59.660 --> 13:00.300
Let me check.

13:01.244 --> 13:01.980
Yes, there is.

13:02.380 --> 13:02.980
And you are?

13:03.260 --> 13:04.540
I'm the son of his friend.

13:05.740 --> 13:06.860
He checked in today.

13:07.288 --> 13:08.760
Do you need me to transfer the call?

13:09.260 --> 13:09.820
No need.

13:09.900 --> 13:11.300
I just wanted to confirm.

13:11.540 --> 13:12.860
Alright, thank you.

13:12.940 --> 13:13.340
Goodbye.

13:34.980 --> 13:35.820
Good evening.

13:36.780 --> 13:37.380
You're back.

13:38.222 --> 13:40.222
Perfect timing,
I have something for you.

13:41.340 --> 13:41.900
What is it?

13:48.140 --> 13:48.780
What's this?

13:49.660 --> 13:51.780
Out of the twenty,
you selected ten promising ones.

13:52.060 --> 13:53.980
But since I haven't
confirmed or signed off yet,

13:54.260 --> 13:55.340
this list

13:55.420 --> 13:57.580
can't be shared with
others in the company for now.

13:57.980 --> 13:59.020
I haven't finalized it yet.

13:59.380 --> 14:00.220
I know.

14:00.420 --> 14:02.250
And these two lists are different.

14:02.250 --> 14:03.266
These ten and those ten,

14:03.311 --> 14:05.340
together make up
the twenty from the selection pool.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.020
So,

14:06.300 --> 14:07.540
this is a test list.

14:07.950 --> 14:09.844
If someone in the company,
out of curiosity,

14:09.888 --> 14:10.820
asks you for the list,

14:10.820 --> 14:12.900
like Mantou or Fragile,

14:13.155 --> 14:14.422
then give it to them.

14:14.580 --> 14:16.540
But you must clearly tell them

14:16.700 --> 14:17.660
not to pass it on.

14:19.420 --> 14:21.020
Of course, besides those two,

14:21.100 --> 14:22.100
there may also be

14:22.100 --> 14:23.460
a third or fourth person asking.

14:23.820 --> 14:24.740
Handle it the same way.

14:25.060 --> 14:26.210
From the twenty,

14:26.210 --> 14:28.180
randomly give them a list of ten.

14:28.660 --> 14:29.220
But

14:29.500 --> 14:30.780
you must make sure

14:31.340 --> 14:33.420
each combination is different.

14:33.860 --> 14:35.060
And you need to keep track

14:35.380 --> 14:37.220
of which set went to whom.

14:38.260 --> 14:40.860
So you're trying to find out
who leaked the list?

14:40.860 --> 14:42.244
Whoever leaks it is the insider.

14:42.580 --> 14:44.460
Zhao Lanxin loves
poaching new authors, right?

14:45.060 --> 14:46.140
So let her keep digging.

14:47.300 --> 14:49.140
Anyone who comes to ask me about it

14:49.140 --> 14:50.500
is already suspicious.

14:51.420 --> 14:52.980
But we don't have evidence,

14:53.460 --> 14:56.180
so the ones asking

14:56.180 --> 14:57.620
might just be curious

14:57.780 --> 14:59.460
or have other reasons.

15:00.300 --> 15:02.100
That's why we need this test.

15:04.500 --> 15:05.860
I'm a bit nervous.

15:06.100 --> 15:07.420
Everyone at the company

15:07.420 --> 15:08.460
has been really nice to me.

15:08.511 --> 15:10.644
Whoever it turns out to be,
it'll be hard to take.

15:12.340 --> 15:14.866
Personal relationships and work
are two different things.

15:16.222 --> 15:17.622
You've gained weight lately.

15:18.311 --> 15:20.511
What kind of takeout
have you been eating?

15:22.980 --> 15:23.420
Hello?

15:24.700 --> 15:25.220
Suicide?

15:27.800 --> 15:29.100
Miss Zhou, I'm really sorry

15:29.100 --> 15:30.733
for causing you both so much trouble.

15:31.340 --> 15:32.300
Why are you all here?

15:33.311 --> 15:35.100
She came looking for you and Zhangzhu.

15:35.180 --> 15:36.355
I said a few words to her.

15:36.780 --> 15:38.380
Then, I asked Mr. Cai to take her home.

15:38.533 --> 15:39.780
I didn't expect that on the way,

15:39.940 --> 15:41.333
she'd try to jump out of the car.

15:43.780 --> 15:44.540
Jump out?

15:44.900 --> 15:45.940
Is she seriously hurt?

15:46.500 --> 15:47.060
She's fine.

15:47.288 --> 15:48.580
She was about to open the door,

15:48.580 --> 15:50.044
and I pulled over immediately.

15:50.266 --> 15:51.666
There's no danger to her life.

15:52.066 --> 15:53.444
The police have already come.

15:53.580 --> 15:54.930
I accompanied Zhou Mei and Mr. Cai

15:54.930 --> 15:56.460
to explain the situation.

15:56.577 --> 15:58.666
There are surveillance
cameras outside your building

15:58.700 --> 16:00.340
that recorded their entire conversation.

16:00.860 --> 16:02.060
It proves there was

16:02.260 --> 16:03.810
no physical contact

16:03.810 --> 16:05.266
or serious conflict between them.

16:05.340 --> 16:06.260
I'm really sorry.

16:06.460 --> 16:08.100
I thought she came looking for Zhangzhu,

16:08.100 --> 16:09.860
since she knows
Zhangzhu lives with Ms. Lin.

16:10.700 --> 16:11.700
But I didn't expect

16:12.700 --> 16:14.340
she thought Ms. Lin and I...

16:16.620 --> 16:18.340
So, I'm really sorry.

16:20.733 --> 16:22.555
Fortunately, Lawyer Bei was with you.

16:22.980 --> 16:24.020
If anything had escalated,

16:24.180 --> 16:25.260
he'd know how to handle it.

16:25.977 --> 16:27.911
I happened to have
dinner with Zhou Mei tonight

16:27.955 --> 16:29.044
to discuss some matters.

16:29.380 --> 16:29.780
Look,

16:30.620 --> 16:32.060
this has disrupted their meal

16:32.860 --> 16:34.940
and their evening.

16:34.940 --> 16:36.340
I'm really sorry.

16:36.460 --> 16:37.460
Sorry, truly sorry.

16:42.900 --> 16:44.220
It was work, just work.

16:44.420 --> 16:45.740
Nothing to do with anything else.

16:46.700 --> 16:49.060
I asked Lawyer Bei to take
a look at a contract for me.

16:49.200 --> 16:51.000
He didn't charge a consultation fee,

16:51.140 --> 16:51.900
so I

16:52.380 --> 16:53.260
treated him to dinner

16:53.780 --> 16:54.380
as a thank-you.

16:57.460 --> 16:59.540
Then, how about I treat
everyone to a meal tomorrow?

16:59.540 --> 17:00.220
Somewhere nearby.

17:01.940 --> 17:03.380
Why are you being so abrupt?

17:04.460 --> 17:05.820
Ms. Lin, Lawyer Bei, and Zhou Mei

17:05.820 --> 17:06.700
are all very busy.

17:06.940 --> 17:08.620
Why don't you ask if they're free first?

17:08.780 --> 17:10.860
Well, if tomorrow doesn't work,
then another day.

17:11.140 --> 17:12.180
Whenever you're free,

17:12.380 --> 17:13.260
I'll treat you.

17:13.466 --> 17:15.340
To be honest,
I have a selfish reason too.

17:15.340 --> 17:17.140
The police are coming again tomorrow,

17:17.311 --> 17:19.644
and with Lawyer Bei there,
I can ask a few more questions.

17:21.488 --> 17:23.380
Don't worry.
I'll definitely be there tomorrow.

17:31.100 --> 17:32.780
If you're free,

17:32.940 --> 17:33.860
you're welcome to join.

17:34.540 --> 17:35.100
Really?

17:35.580 --> 17:36.420
That's great.

17:37.460 --> 17:38.100
Thank you.

17:38.100 --> 17:39.177
Thank you, Lawyer Bei.

17:39.700 --> 17:40.140
Well,

17:41.260 --> 17:43.460
Miss Zhou,
your male friend is really decent.

17:43.860 --> 17:44.260
Really.

17:44.340 --> 17:45.540
You're lucky, Miss Zhou.

17:47.660 --> 17:49.060
Zhou Mei and I will head back first.

17:50.260 --> 17:51.260
And Lawyer Bei

17:51.420 --> 17:52.980
should go home to his wife and child.

18:06.540 --> 18:06.980
Then...

18:08.580 --> 18:09.300
It's settled

18:10.140 --> 18:10.940
for tomorrow.

18:12.260 --> 18:13.500
See you tomorrow.

18:13.620 --> 18:13.980
Alright.

18:14.140 --> 18:14.500
Okay.

18:14.660 --> 18:14.980
Alright.

18:15.940 --> 18:17.180
Should I

18:18.460 --> 18:19.500
send you three back?

18:20.100 --> 18:21.420
No need. It's not on the way.

18:21.820 --> 18:22.660
We'll take a taxi.

18:24.780 --> 18:25.540
Then, how about

18:25.900 --> 18:26.660
I send you back?

18:28.100 --> 18:28.820
Alright, thanks.

18:43.700 --> 18:44.740
So when Zhangzhu's dad

18:44.740 --> 18:46.020
called you just now,

18:46.700 --> 18:48.620
you were already
having dinner with Lawyer Bei?

18:49.580 --> 18:50.460
We had just sat down.

18:50.533 --> 18:51.933
Hadn't even started eating yet.

18:51.980 --> 18:53.844
Ms. Mei, weren't you supposed to
have dinner

18:53.866 --> 18:54.955
with Lawyer Bei tomorrow?

18:55.066 --> 18:56.577
He had something come up tomorrow,

18:56.622 --> 18:57.755
so we moved it to today.

18:59.980 --> 19:01.540
He just agreed to have a meal

19:01.540 --> 19:03.111
with Zhangzhu's dad tomorrow.

19:03.511 --> 19:05.466
How could he suddenly
have plans tomorrow?

19:05.711 --> 19:08.377
It's not the first time
he's changed plans at the last minute.

19:11.300 --> 19:12.380
He just has a lot going on.

19:19.460 --> 19:20.860
He's teaching you

19:22.820 --> 19:23.700
to fall in line.

19:35.980 --> 19:36.380
Alright.

19:43.900 --> 19:45.820
My dad has already
booked a place for tomorrow.

19:46.180 --> 19:47.260
Didn't you all agree

19:47.260 --> 19:47.940
to go together?

19:49.220 --> 19:50.140
Send me the address.

19:50.540 --> 19:51.933
Mei and I will head over tomorrow.

19:53.860 --> 19:54.300
Okay.

20:03.740 --> 20:04.780
Working this late again?

20:05.700 --> 20:07.220
Your boss is exploiting you.

20:07.288 --> 20:08.444
You could report her.

20:08.888 --> 20:10.330
I've got a session with Zhang Yousen,

20:10.330 --> 20:11.540
doing some online Q&A.

20:13.333 --> 20:14.940
He's more reliable than AI, right?

20:15.888 --> 20:17.488
I'm the one answering his questions.

20:17.755 --> 20:19.410
What questions could
you answer for him?

20:19.410 --> 20:20.820
What kind of man Zhou Mei likes.

20:21.711 --> 20:23.780
Whether Zhou Mei
actually wants to get married.

20:23.780 --> 20:24.780
Why Zhou Mei broke up

20:24.780 --> 20:26.300
with each of her exes.

20:26.420 --> 20:28.619
Why Zhou Mei still
doesn't have a steady boyfriend.

20:28.620 --> 20:29.822
Whether Zhou Mei has even

20:29.900 --> 20:32.220
the slightest interest in Zhang Yousen.

20:33.620 --> 20:35.340
Can you even answer
any of those yourself?

20:37.340 --> 20:38.060
No.

20:38.288 --> 20:40.133
That's why we're
discussing it as a group.

20:43.380 --> 20:43.980
He's online.

20:45.100 --> 20:48.540
(Zhang Yousen
invites you to a voice call)

20:48.740 --> 20:49.380
Are you home yet?

20:50.300 --> 20:51.060
Is Zhou Mei back?

20:52.420 --> 20:52.980
Not yet.

20:53.780 --> 20:55.300
She probably went out with her friend.

20:56.044 --> 20:57.420
Then let's talk a bit longer.

20:57.740 --> 20:58.980
Maybe she'll be back soon.

21:00.180 --> 21:01.380
I want to ask you something.

21:02.700 --> 21:04.740
It's also something I
want to tell Zhou Mei.

21:05.180 --> 21:05.700
Go ahead.

21:06.111 --> 21:07.660
Our company is opening a new branch.

21:07.844 --> 21:09.111
It's the Southwest branch.

21:09.940 --> 21:10.940
They need someone to go,

21:11.533 --> 21:13.311
but once you go, it's for two years.

21:14.088 --> 21:16.511
After that,
there's a chance to become a partner.

21:17.820 --> 21:18.940
I'm thinking of applying,

21:19.940 --> 21:20.940
but I'm worried

21:22.022 --> 21:24.133
that if I go,
I won't see her for a long time.

21:27.466 --> 21:29.180
I originally planned
to have Zhang Yousen

21:29.180 --> 21:31.180
help Zhangzhu
manage new author contracts.

21:31.511 --> 21:33.600
Didn't expect
the conversation to go this way.

21:33.980 --> 21:35.820
If you can motivate a young person

21:36.420 --> 21:37.900
to work hard because of this,

21:38.700 --> 21:40.420
then you've done
at least one good thing,

21:41.740 --> 21:42.860
enough to offset

21:43.580 --> 21:45.540
a tiny fraction of
your many wrongdoings.

21:51.740 --> 21:52.740
But speaking of which,

21:52.940 --> 21:54.580
Zhangzhu works pretty hard.

21:54.777 --> 21:56.444
You've found a good assistant this time.

21:56.820 --> 21:58.620
She leans a bit too much
toward outsiders.

21:58.888 --> 21:59.822
What do you mean?

22:00.180 --> 22:01.580
She's good at screening new authors,

22:02.577 --> 22:04.620
but that's because
she found a great helper.

22:05.260 --> 22:05.980
Experienced,

22:06.460 --> 22:07.180
fast at reading,

22:07.580 --> 22:09.420
and most importantly, fits my taste.

22:13.220 --> 22:13.820
Who?

22:15.100 --> 22:15.740
He Han?

22:17.060 --> 22:18.340
They think I don't know.

22:22.860 --> 22:24.340
Don't tell me He Han

22:24.377 --> 22:26.133
is trying to get back with you again?

22:34.580 --> 22:35.980
This time is different.

22:38.700 --> 22:40.380
We've been apart for so long,

22:41.780 --> 22:42.980
so there's no going back.

22:47.700 --> 22:49.140
I don't think he sees it that way.

22:57.420 --> 22:58.820
Author Night invitation.

22:59.700 --> 23:00.540
Will you go with me?

23:02.220 --> 23:03.460
This year's Author of the Year

23:03.460 --> 23:04.980
will most likely be Gu Yan.

23:05.177 --> 23:06.377
If you're not winning anything,

23:06.380 --> 23:07.060
why would I go?

23:07.500 --> 23:08.540
I'd rather spend that time

23:09.140 --> 23:10.660
reading a novel.

23:10.940 --> 23:12.044
Then I won't go either.

23:12.500 --> 23:13.540
You have to go.

23:14.100 --> 23:16.140
If you don't, you'll look petty.

23:16.700 --> 23:17.780
Not only do you have to go,

23:17.900 --> 23:19.940
but you also need to
manage your expressions.

23:21.260 --> 23:23.420
When Gu Yan goes on
stage to accept the award,

23:23.420 --> 23:25.020
you need to show your congratulations

23:25.020 --> 23:27.180
to both Gu Yan and Lin Zhanqiao.

23:31.100 --> 23:31.620
See you.

23:42.100 --> 23:45.580
(Dingqi 2024 Annual Author Night)

23:49.460 --> 23:50.060
Hey,

23:51.540 --> 23:53.140
every time you meet Lawyer Bei,

23:53.140 --> 23:54.660
do you really need two hours

23:54.660 --> 23:55.620
to get ready like this?

23:55.900 --> 23:56.511
Of course.

23:58.200 --> 24:00.155
And you're going to
dinner dressed like that?

24:00.780 --> 24:01.555
What's wrong?

24:01.822 --> 24:04.044
Aren't you going to
change into something nicer?

24:04.100 --> 24:06.260
At least show some respect
for the people there.

24:06.500 --> 24:08.060
I'll show it with my attitude.

24:08.740 --> 24:09.740
That's enough.

24:11.460 --> 24:12.060
You know,

24:12.700 --> 24:14.780
this dinner
is actually quite special to me.

24:15.420 --> 24:15.980
Why?

24:17.340 --> 24:18.940
This is the first time Lawyer Bei and I

24:19.066 --> 24:20.666
are having a meal with my friends.

24:21.060 --> 24:22.500
Before, he would never do this.

24:23.244 --> 24:24.311
You get what I mean?

24:24.340 --> 24:24.820
Not really.

24:26.244 --> 24:28.977
If you put it that way,
I kind of don't want to go anymore.

24:29.220 --> 24:30.420
I originally thought

24:30.444 --> 24:32.355
this was just Cai Dezhang's
thank-you dinner.

24:33.660 --> 24:35.180
It is a thank-you dinner,

24:35.820 --> 24:37.620
but to me, it means something different.

24:38.380 --> 24:39.500
If I didn't tell you,

24:39.500 --> 24:40.500
you wouldn't know.

24:41.620 --> 24:42.620
But now you do.

24:45.020 --> 24:46.580
So in reality, you're having an affair.

24:47.180 --> 24:48.220
Cai Dezhang and Zhangzhu

24:48.220 --> 24:49.700
are just your cover.

24:50.100 --> 24:51.580
Don't put it so harshly.

24:51.844 --> 24:54.133
This is something private
between Lawyer Bei and me.

24:57.180 --> 24:58.020
Zhangzhu is calling.

24:59.660 --> 25:00.020
Hello?

25:00.300 --> 25:01.260
Are you on your way?

25:01.340 --> 25:02.711
I'll get there a bit earlier.

25:03.260 --> 25:04.780
Lawyer Bei asked to add one more seat.

25:05.020 --> 25:06.180
His wife will be joining us.

25:17.740 --> 25:18.700
Alright, I got it.

25:19.300 --> 25:19.620
Okay.

25:19.860 --> 25:20.500
See you later.

25:21.780 --> 25:22.260
See you.

25:30.620 --> 25:32.460
Lawyer Bei said he's bringing his wife.

25:36.980 --> 25:37.420
Why?

25:38.111 --> 25:39.600
Did she insist on coming?

25:42.066 --> 25:43.666
Why didn't he say this earlier?

25:43.977 --> 25:45.422
What do you think his purpose is?

25:48.260 --> 25:48.620
First,

25:49.333 --> 25:51.844
he doesn't want others to
question your relationship.

25:52.780 --> 25:53.140
Second,

25:53.980 --> 25:55.420
he wants you to know your place.

25:56.700 --> 25:57.140
Third,

25:57.666 --> 25:58.860
he wants you to understand

25:58.980 --> 26:00.060
that on important occasions,

26:00.140 --> 26:01.940
he will show up with his wife.

26:03.860 --> 26:05.622
So you get used to it and accept it.

26:12.044 --> 26:13.333
So are you still going?

26:16.180 --> 26:16.580
Of course.

26:17.288 --> 26:18.311
Why wouldn't I?

26:28.180 --> 26:28.860
Don't worry.

26:29.620 --> 26:31.580
I've never wanted to ruin his marriage.

26:32.060 --> 26:33.140
He knows that.

26:34.340 --> 26:36.020
If I were you, I wouldn't go.

26:36.488 --> 26:38.266
Even if you go, you won't be happy.

26:38.400 --> 26:39.666
And if I don't go, I will be?

26:41.220 --> 26:41.780
I promise,

26:42.133 --> 26:43.580
I'll act more sincerely than anyone

26:43.580 --> 26:45.060
in wishing his marriage well.

26:45.860 --> 26:46.220
Let's go.

27:20.980 --> 27:22.260
I'm in construction.

27:22.260 --> 27:23.580
You could say I'm a careful man.

27:24.100 --> 27:25.288
But compared to Lawyer Bei,

27:25.300 --> 27:26.100
I'm nothing.

27:26.980 --> 27:29.220
His mind is so meticulous
that nothing slips through.

27:29.300 --> 27:30.780
What you think of and what you don't,

27:31.060 --> 27:32.466
he's already thought it through.

27:32.860 --> 27:33.660
You flatter me.

27:34.220 --> 27:35.340
Part of our job

27:35.340 --> 27:37.155
is to prevent problems
before they happen.

27:37.260 --> 27:37.780
Mrs. Bei,

27:37.900 --> 27:38.977
having a husband like him

27:39.140 --> 27:39.740
is impressive.

27:40.700 --> 27:41.420
You wouldn't know.

27:41.660 --> 27:42.780
Our friends all say

27:43.220 --> 27:44.260
he's incredibly sharp,

27:44.260 --> 27:46.500
born to be a lawyer.

27:46.660 --> 27:47.020
Right?

27:47.660 --> 27:48.860
Ms. Lin and Zhou Mei are here.

27:48.860 --> 27:50.222
- I'll go greet them.
- Alright.

27:50.900 --> 27:51.420
Ms. Lin,

27:53.820 --> 27:54.660
they're all here.

28:00.580 --> 28:01.400
Hello, Ms. Lin.

28:02.088 --> 28:02.900
Hello, Miss Zhou.

28:03.020 --> 28:03.460
Mr. Cai.

28:05.740 --> 28:06.660
You must be Mrs. Bei.

28:09.540 --> 28:10.888
Let me introduce everyone.

28:11.300 --> 28:12.260
This is Zhou Mei.

28:12.780 --> 28:13.820
This is Lin Zhanqiao.

28:14.580 --> 28:16.260
Zhanqiao is Zhangzhu's boss.

28:17.980 --> 28:18.900
This is my wife.

28:20.900 --> 28:21.540
Hello, Miss Lin.

28:21.900 --> 28:22.844
Hello, Miss Zhou.

28:23.500 --> 28:25.740
Young women these days
are truly accomplished.

28:27.380 --> 28:29.540
Come, have a seat.
Don't just stand there.

28:29.540 --> 28:30.220
Sit.

28:31.511 --> 28:32.244
Ms. Lin, here.

28:34.500 --> 28:34.860
Ms. Lin.

28:35.300 --> 28:35.740
Thank you.

28:41.340 --> 28:41.740
Thank you.

28:52.460 --> 28:53.540
Excuse me, pour the wine.

28:55.620 --> 28:57.220
It's not easy to get everyone together.

28:58.180 --> 28:58.500
Come.

28:58.940 --> 28:59.660
Napkin here.

29:00.444 --> 29:01.180
Thank you, Dear.

29:02.860 --> 29:03.940
Lawyer Bei, have some wine.

29:04.740 --> 29:05.140
Of course.

29:05.820 --> 29:06.260
Thank you.

29:06.333 --> 29:08.066
This wine was recommended by a friend.

29:08.700 --> 29:09.300
Give it a try.

29:11.622 --> 29:13.100
Please add another set of utensils.

29:13.100 --> 29:14.222
There will be one more person.

29:14.266 --> 29:15.311
Alright, just a moment.

29:16.400 --> 29:17.260
Who did you invite?

29:18.740 --> 29:19.580
My boyfriend.

29:23.380 --> 29:25.380
Mei,
since when have you had a boyfriend?

29:25.740 --> 29:26.620
I've always had one.

29:27.340 --> 29:28.420
You just didn't know.

29:33.888 --> 29:35.620
With how beautiful you are, Miss Zhou,

29:35.820 --> 29:37.580
there must be countless men chasing you.

29:37.820 --> 29:38.420
Zhanqiao,

29:38.940 --> 29:40.700
have you met Zhou Mei's boyfriend?

29:46.380 --> 29:46.940
She has.

29:48.940 --> 29:49.260
Yes.

29:50.140 --> 29:50.620
Who is it?

29:53.740 --> 29:55.220
Does your boyfriend drink?

29:57.222 --> 29:58.260
He can drink a little.

29:59.340 --> 30:00.700
Here, pour that glass.

30:01.340 --> 30:02.780
And add one more serving,

30:03.340 --> 30:04.288
same as the others.

30:04.820 --> 30:05.260
Thank you.

30:14.140 --> 30:15.460
Mrs. Bei, are you working now

30:16.380 --> 30:17.580
or helping Lawyer Bei

30:17.580 --> 30:19.100
with things at home and outside?

30:20.380 --> 30:22.220
We sent our son abroad last year,

30:22.780 --> 30:24.340
so now I've

30:24.420 --> 30:25.466
started working again.

30:25.540 --> 30:25.860
Yes.

30:27.020 --> 30:28.940
What kind of business
does your company do?

30:29.820 --> 30:30.740
Just some

30:30.740 --> 30:32.420
product packaging design and the like.

30:32.780 --> 30:34.500
I just run a small studio.

30:34.820 --> 30:36.700
More of a personal interest.

30:37.140 --> 30:38.380
Thanks to my husband.

30:38.620 --> 30:40.380
Everything is arranged perfectly for me.

30:41.020 --> 30:42.660
I really just got pushed into it.

30:42.911 --> 30:43.955
Give it a try.

30:45.060 --> 30:47.220
See, when choosing a boyfriend,

30:47.377 --> 30:49.220
you should find someone like Lawyer Bei.

30:50.220 --> 30:51.620
A truly capable man

30:51.700 --> 30:53.180
can take care of everything,

30:53.180 --> 30:54.700
both work and family.

30:55.060 --> 30:55.860
I'm not like that.

30:56.060 --> 30:57.180
If I take care of one side,

30:57.180 --> 30:58.340
I can't handle the other.

30:59.740 --> 31:00.340
Mei,

31:00.820 --> 31:02.100
what does your boyfriend do?

31:03.900 --> 31:04.940
He's also a lawyer.

31:15.800 --> 31:16.700
What a coincidence.

31:17.111 --> 31:19.220
Then he should have
a good talk with Lawyer Bei,

31:19.220 --> 31:20.377
and learn a thing or two.

31:21.220 --> 31:22.260
It's a rare opportunity,

31:22.340 --> 31:23.244
isn't it, Lawyer Bei?

31:23.511 --> 31:24.220
You flatter me.

31:24.420 --> 31:25.820
We can learn from each other.

31:27.820 --> 31:28.420
Actually,

31:29.266 --> 31:30.820
he's already learning from Lawyer Bei.

31:36.620 --> 31:37.100
Really?

31:37.244 --> 31:37.980
What a coincidence.

31:38.300 --> 31:39.300
Is he a colleague

31:39.420 --> 31:40.660
of my husband's firm?

31:42.260 --> 31:42.700
Dear,

31:43.260 --> 31:44.740
you never mentioned him.

31:48.340 --> 31:49.380
Zhang Yousen?

31:51.400 --> 31:52.088
Over here.

31:55.460 --> 31:55.780
Come.

32:03.820 --> 32:04.380
Lawyer Bei.

32:05.020 --> 32:05.460
Mrs. Bei.

32:06.700 --> 32:07.340
Zhangzhu.

32:07.860 --> 32:08.260
Ms. Lin.

32:08.822 --> 32:09.666
Hello, Ms. Lin.

32:10.660 --> 32:11.460
And this is?

32:11.933 --> 32:12.733
Have a seat.

32:12.940 --> 32:14.660
This is Zhangzhu's father.

32:16.260 --> 32:16.980
Hello, Mr. Cai.

32:17.088 --> 32:18.533
- Hello.
- I'm Zhang Yousen.

32:18.740 --> 32:20.660
What a fine young man, well-presented.

32:21.620 --> 32:22.780
Miss Zhou,

32:23.066 --> 32:24.500
your boyfriend is quite young.

32:28.100 --> 32:30.140
So your boyfriend is Zhang Yousen.

32:30.980 --> 32:32.140
What a small world.

32:32.900 --> 32:35.020
Yousen is Lawyer Bei's assistant.

32:36.500 --> 32:36.980
Miss Zhou,

32:37.500 --> 32:39.220
did you meet Zhang Yousen first

32:39.580 --> 32:41.060
or Lawyer Bei first?

32:42.420 --> 32:44.940
Lawyer Bei introduced me to Zhou Mei.

32:45.380 --> 32:46.220
For work reasons.

32:47.020 --> 32:47.700
Zhang Yousen,

32:47.911 --> 32:50.533
you really had me fooled,
keeping this from me all this time.

32:51.180 --> 32:52.460
When did you two get together?

32:52.460 --> 32:53.980
I had no idea.

32:54.288 --> 32:56.977
I really thought you were secretly
in love with Zhou Mei all along.

33:00.020 --> 33:01.260
I'm quite surprised, too.

33:01.420 --> 33:02.400
We've only been together

33:02.580 --> 33:03.180
for a few days.

33:05.620 --> 33:06.180
Miss Zhou,

33:06.660 --> 33:07.660
before this,

33:07.777 --> 33:09.020
were you single all along?

33:11.866 --> 33:12.977
You could say that.

33:16.260 --> 33:17.780
Miss Lin, you're single too, right?

33:20.733 --> 33:22.822
I don't really have
time for a relationship.

33:24.300 --> 33:25.580
You women are all so capable.

33:27.288 --> 33:28.490
If you're going to find someone,

33:28.500 --> 33:30.288
it should be someone
who can take care of you.

33:36.780 --> 33:37.780
Not having a boyfriend

33:38.444 --> 33:40.155
doesn't mean there's no one you like.

33:55.780 --> 33:57.488
You have someone you like, Ms. Lin?

34:00.180 --> 34:02.020
There's a lot to take in today.

34:04.100 --> 34:05.400
Come. Let's serve the dishes.

34:11.180 --> 34:11.580
Thank you.

34:13.620 --> 34:13.940
Come.

34:14.555 --> 34:15.533
Let me make a toast.

34:16.260 --> 34:16.740
Today,

34:17.288 --> 34:18.180
thank you, everyone.

34:18.620 --> 34:21.340
Especially Lawyer Bei and Ms. Lin,

34:21.620 --> 34:23.460
for taking care of Zhangzhu
during this time.

34:23.980 --> 34:25.340
Thank you all. Let's have a drink.

34:39.800 --> 34:41.755
Why am I the only one
finishing my glass?

34:42.540 --> 34:43.800
Here, I'll drink with you.

34:46.380 --> 34:46.900
Zhang Yousen,

34:48.060 --> 34:49.380
why is your face so red?

34:49.860 --> 34:50.780
Is it from the alcohol,

34:50.780 --> 34:52.020
or because of Zhou Mei?

34:53.340 --> 34:54.060
I just feel

34:54.780 --> 34:56.140
so lucky.

35:02.311 --> 35:03.380
Lawyer Bei, thank you

35:03.460 --> 35:04.955
for introducing Zhou Mei to me.

35:05.860 --> 35:06.700
Thank you, Mrs. Bei.

35:07.111 --> 35:08.333
Thank you, everyone.

35:18.820 --> 35:19.300
Thank you,

35:20.340 --> 35:20.780
Zhou Mei.

35:49.340 --> 35:51.300
So sweet.

35:53.940 --> 35:54.500
Oh my.

36:05.580 --> 36:06.540
Miss Zhou. Miss Lin.

36:06.622 --> 36:08.000
Let's add each other on WeChat.

36:08.133 --> 36:10.244
Come over to our place when you're free.

36:14.580 --> 36:14.980
Sure.

36:28.333 --> 36:30.355
We'll grab a taxi across the street.

36:31.860 --> 36:32.180
Bye.

36:32.180 --> 36:32.900
Let's go, Miss Zhou.

36:32.940 --> 36:33.340
Bye.

36:33.340 --> 36:34.511
- Take care.
- Bye.

36:36.911 --> 36:38.066
Lawyer Bei, Mrs. Bei,

36:38.180 --> 36:39.088
you too, take care.

36:40.020 --> 36:41.180
Thank you for coming today.

36:41.333 --> 36:42.577
If you ever need anything

36:42.660 --> 36:44.100
related to real estate,

36:44.200 --> 36:45.140
just let me know.

36:45.300 --> 36:46.800
Thank you for your kind invitation.

36:46.860 --> 36:48.320
I'm sure we'll be troubling you again.

36:48.340 --> 36:48.800
Definitely.

36:48.900 --> 36:49.260
Alright.

36:49.540 --> 36:49.940
Take care.

36:50.066 --> 36:50.460
Goodbye.

36:50.460 --> 36:50.780
Alright.

36:50.860 --> 36:51.180
Bye.

36:51.180 --> 36:51.920
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

36:51.980 --> 36:52.420
Bye.

36:52.740 --> 36:53.140
Bye.

37:42.060 --> 37:42.800
The car's here.

37:44.020 --> 37:44.340
Okay.

37:45.300 --> 37:45.820
Then...

37:46.660 --> 37:47.380
I'll get going.

37:47.644 --> 37:50.260
My girlfriend is still in the hospital,
getting discharged tomorrow.

37:50.700 --> 37:51.700
Miss Qian

37:51.900 --> 37:52.420
is fine now?

37:52.733 --> 37:53.460
She's alright.

37:53.533 --> 37:54.580
It wasn't a serious fall.

37:54.580 --> 37:55.460
Just a check-up.

38:00.620 --> 38:02.980
Zhangzhu, stay a few more days
at Ms. Lin's place.

38:03.420 --> 38:05.088
I'll come find you once I'm done here.

38:05.288 --> 38:07.133
No need to come find me. I'm doing fine.

38:07.220 --> 38:08.000
That won't do.

38:08.844 --> 38:10.222
How about I give you a ride?

38:10.860 --> 38:12.300
No need. It's easy to get a taxi.

38:13.660 --> 38:14.580
Alright, we're off.

38:17.660 --> 38:18.300
Take care.

38:29.020 --> 38:33.500
(Zhanqiao: Clean up your posts,
and remove what needs removing.)

38:38.020 --> 38:38.820
So why?

38:40.044 --> 38:41.300
Why did you suddenly say yes?

38:41.660 --> 38:42.780
And in front of everyone.

38:42.780 --> 38:43.940
I still can't believe it.

38:46.820 --> 38:47.820
Just on a whim.

38:48.940 --> 38:50.140
Sometimes, you don't

38:50.140 --> 38:51.644
need a reason for things like this.

38:52.460 --> 38:52.900
Zhou Mei,

38:54.020 --> 38:54.420
thank you.

38:55.700 --> 38:56.100
Really.

38:56.940 --> 38:58.420
Even if it was just on a whim.

39:01.820 --> 39:03.340
I should be the one thanking you.

39:31.220 --> 39:32.940
Leave the door unlocked for Mei.

39:33.780 --> 39:35.180
I thought she and Zhang Yousen...

39:36.460 --> 39:37.620
She'll be back later.

39:41.860 --> 39:43.020
Do you want some wontons?

39:44.740 --> 39:45.220
Now?

39:46.060 --> 39:47.210
Didn't we just eat?

39:47.210 --> 39:48.820
That didn't really count as eating.

39:49.511 --> 39:51.400
If you don't want any,
just watch me eat.

39:53.220 --> 39:55.860
So we're going for wontons now?

39:56.111 --> 39:56.977
Of course.

39:57.540 --> 39:58.380
What did you think,

39:59.060 --> 40:00.580
that I was walking you home?

40:01.780 --> 40:02.340
No.

40:02.820 --> 40:03.820
I'm just a bit nervous.

40:04.260 --> 40:06.060
I share an apartment with friends.

40:10.977 --> 40:13.140
Add this, and that's the authentic
Shanghai flavor.

40:15.540 --> 40:16.540
Do you come here often?

40:17.622 --> 40:19.266
Been eating here for over 20 years.

40:21.155 --> 40:22.711
This place has been around that long?

40:25.940 --> 40:27.340
I lived upstairs when I was a kid.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.777
So your mom used
to bring you here a lot?

40:32.140 --> 40:33.260
Acting like a wild kid, huh?

40:33.711 --> 40:34.644
Come on, let's go.

40:34.820 --> 40:35.822
Come home with me.

40:39.700 --> 40:40.940
(Buying all this useless stuff!)

40:40.940 --> 40:42.155
(Everything in my house...)

40:42.780 --> 40:43.700
(Yes, it's all yours.)

40:43.700 --> 40:44.580
(Year 2004)
Touch them, and I'll fight you!

40:44.580 --> 40:45.300
I'll touch them, so what?

40:45.300 --> 40:46.340
Are you even human?

40:46.980 --> 40:47.900
I'm not human?

40:47.900 --> 40:48.780
You're a beast!

40:48.780 --> 40:49.540
I'm a beast?

40:49.540 --> 40:51.155
Even a beast has more dignity than you.

40:51.420 --> 40:52.410
Then you married a beast.

40:52.410 --> 40:53.740
- Shut up!
- Who do you think you are?

40:53.740 --> 40:54.860
You're no better.

40:54.860 --> 40:56.390
- I'm telling you.
- Get out.

40:57.500 --> 40:58.540
Don't ever come back.

40:59.540 --> 41:00.570
Come in and sit.

41:00.570 --> 41:01.911
I will make you a bowl of wontons.

41:02.900 --> 41:03.700
(Arguing again?)

41:03.700 --> 41:05.620
♪My heart is beating still♪

41:06.740 --> 41:09.660
♪Sometimes I feel alone♪

41:10.311 --> 41:11.488
What are you thinking about?

41:11.933 --> 41:13.100
Thinking about your mom?

41:13.100 --> 41:15.444
She used to bring you here
to sit in this spot, right?

41:16.140 --> 41:16.540
Yeah.

41:18.340 --> 41:19.500
Was she

41:19.500 --> 41:20.733
as strict with you back then?

41:21.860 --> 41:24.420
♪That lies inside my head♪

41:24.420 --> 41:24.980
Not really.

41:27.580 --> 41:29.020
So you miss this place

41:30.300 --> 41:31.380
because it holds

41:32.020 --> 41:33.500
your childhood memories, right?

41:39.220 --> 41:39.980
♪I guess I guess♪

41:39.980 --> 41:45.300
♪It's rising from my silence♪

41:46.820 --> 41:49.300
♪I'm nothing but the one♪

41:49.300 --> 41:53.420
♪Who paints the blue sky♪

41:54.500 --> 41:56.100
♪With all of my tears♪

41:56.100 --> 41:57.380
♪And past pain♪

41:58.844 --> 42:00.755
I really wish I had met you back then.

42:03.220 --> 42:06.540
♪Please stay with me♪

42:07.340 --> 42:08.660
You weren't even born yet.

42:08.820 --> 42:10.260
Then I wish I were a few years older,

42:10.940 --> 42:11.580
so when

42:11.580 --> 42:13.060
your mom brought you here,

42:13.644 --> 42:15.533
I could pretend to come eat here, too.

42:15.977 --> 42:16.780
When I was little,

42:17.140 --> 42:18.420
I was smart and well-behaved.

42:19.100 --> 42:21.100
Your mom would definitely have liked me.

42:22.260 --> 42:23.020
And I'd tell her,

42:23.866 --> 42:25.022
Mrs. Zhou, don't worry.

42:25.740 --> 42:26.900
I'll protect her forever.

42:27.020 --> 42:31.340
♪Don't bind my soul♪

42:37.500 --> 42:38.180
Thank you.

42:40.155 --> 42:41.460
What do you usually like to eat?

42:44.020 --> 42:44.700
I like noodles.

42:46.380 --> 42:47.700
Then, next time,

42:47.700 --> 42:49.200
take me to eat your favorite noodles.

42:49.540 --> 42:50.060
Better not.

42:50.740 --> 42:52.140
You might not like what I like.

42:52.444 --> 42:53.420
Then you'd be unhappy.

42:53.900 --> 42:55.100
Who's happy all the time?

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪

45:31.260 --> 45:31.820
Someone there?

45:33.660 --> 45:35.420
If you like pretty girls,

45:35.444 --> 45:36.777
then go ahead and pursue them.

45:36.980 --> 45:37.780
But don't think

45:37.780 --> 45:39.260
dating a few girls can provoke me.

45:39.980 --> 45:41.060
I don't care at all.

45:41.420 --> 45:43.020
The one who laughs last laughs best.

45:43.420 --> 45:45.300
When I received this award back then,

45:45.700 --> 45:47.500
the one by my side supporting me

45:47.820 --> 45:48.980
was my best partner,

45:49.420 --> 45:50.100
Lin Zhanqiao.

45:50.533 --> 45:52.740
Even though this year
I'm not here to receive an award,

45:53.260 --> 45:54.460
the one beside me

45:54.860 --> 45:55.580
is still her.
